#pragma code_page(65001)
// res/lang/lv.rc -- Latvian (lv-LV), the strings of the interface for `[general] language = "lv"`.
//
// Stage E109, group B: adapted (not translated word for word) by the translator window of the language;
// the same two string tables as en.rc, the same IDs in the same order. Where each string is seen and how much
// room it has is res/lang/context.tsv; tests/l10n.rs holds this file to en.rc.
//
// In an .rc string a backslash is an escape -- one backslash is written as two -- and a double
// quote inside a string is written as two double quotes. The code page line above is this
// file's own: without it rc.exe reads the file in the ANSI code page, silently.

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Latvian -- `[general] language = "lv"`.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
